  '{"event_name":"Procurement & Supply Chain LIVE: The US Summit 2026","event_url":"https://supplychaindigital.com/events/procurement-supply-chain-live/procurement-supply-chain-live-chicago-2026","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"original_line":11,"dates":"April 21-22, 2026","location":"Chicago, IL","cost":"Early Bird available with $448 savings","venue":"Navy Pier","description":"Premier event bringing together senior procurement and supply chain leaders focused on innovation, strategy, and transformation. Co-located with Sustainability LIVE: The US Summit. Features 100+ expert speakers covering 20 core content themes with over 1,000 attendees expected.","industry_vertical":"supply chain and distribution","exhibitor_mix":"Procurement software platforms, supply chain management systems, sourcing technology, supplier collaboration tools, analytics platforms, digital transformation solutions, and logistics technology providers","audience_mix":"Senior executives, procurement leaders, supply chain professionals, sustainability champions, and technology partners across North America including C/V/D level executives from enterprise organizations. Over 2,000 combined attendees with Sustainability LIVE.","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Previously known as Procurement & Supply Chain LIVE: Chicago, rebranded as The US Summit in 2026. Features US Awards ceremony on April 21. Organized by BizClik Media in partnership with Procurement Magazine and Supply Chain Digital.","original_event_name":"Procurement & Supply Chain LIVE","original_event_url":"https://supplychaindigital.com/events/procurement-supply-chain-live/procurement-supply-chain-live-chicago-2026?gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=23549191152&gbraid=0AAAAACjTaLHS9xINAcjnO6BuI_N_dMU5u&gclid=Cj0KCQjw7IjOBhDyARIsAFzrWQz5Tr3h3SK4Jc86xyclUeKlHAdaLBOIXKjoNa8fDfVPBxtuDNm5gksaAvlcEALw_wcB","added_to_master":"2026-03-31T11:49:29.130731","master_id":31,"overall_score":7.8,"scores":{"supply_chain_vertical_alignment":{"score":7,"rationale":"Procurement and supply chain leadership event. Procurement is rated 6-7 in criteria hierarchy but upper range applies here. Event broad-spectrum supply chain without deep specialization in asset-light 3PLs, freight forwarding, or LTL (highest tiers). Attendees span multiple supply chain segments."},"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":9,"rationale":"Senior procurement leaders, supply chain professionals, and sustainability champions. Event explicitly targets C/V/D level executives. Audience is procurement and supply chain operations-focused. Direct alignment with buyer functions that evaluate operational efficiency and digital transformation."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":8,"rationale":"Major multi-track event in April 2026 (1,000+ attendees, 100+ speakers) at strong US location (Chicago, Navy Pier). Co-located with Sustainability LIVE adds adjacent audience. Rebranding as The US Summit in 2026 signals investment and expansion. Features awards ceremony indicating prestige."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":9,"rationale":"Event explicitly attracts C/V/D level executives from enterprise organizations. 2,000+ combined attendees (with Sustainability LIVE) but core procurement track focuses on senior buyer concentration. Focus on innovation and strategy indicates decision-maker participation."}},"reasoning":"Strong supply chain event with excellent buyer seniority and functional alignment. Procurement leaders are key stakeholders in distribution and supply chain transformation decisions. April timing in Chicago, 1,000+ attendees, 100+ speakers on 20 content themes indicate comprehensive scope and decision-maker density. Co-location with Sustainability LIVE broadens adjacent buyer segments. Rebranding as The US Summit signals major 2026 investment.","sales_brief":"Priority #3 event for supply chain positioning. Procurement & Supply Chain LIVE attracts 1,000+ C/V/D level supply chain professionals focused on transformation and innovation - exceptional buyer seniority. April timing + Chicago location + 100+ speaker lineup across 20 themes = high volume of active solution-seekers. Procurement leaders are key stakeholders in distribution tech decisions but not always primary buyers. Risk: Horizontal supply chain audience (procurement, logistics, visibility) may dilute distribution concentration vs. vertical-specific events."}'::jsonb
