  'Priority #1 supply chain event for InstaLILY. ISM World combines exceptional buyer seniority (2,000+ including dedicated VP+ track), strong procurement/supply management focus, and hands-on problem-solving format. April timing + Denver + 15-min airport access = easy attendance. Institutional credibility by Institute for Supply Management ensures qualified attendees. Category managers and sourcing directors face multi-SKU, multi-location complexity identical to distribution operations. Strong buyer intent signals via workshop focus. Risk: Broad supply management scope (not distribution-specific) may require vertical targeting within event.',
  '{"event_name":"ISM World 2026","event_url":"https://www.ismworld.org/events/conferences-and-events/annual-conference/","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"original_line":12,"dates":"April 26-28, 2026","location":"Aurora/Denver, CO","cost":"Member: $1,695, Non-Member: $1,995 (Standard Pricing)","venue":"Gaylord Rockies Resort & Convention Center","description":"The premier annual conference for supply management professionals featuring education through experience with hands-on workshops, problem-solving labs, and executive panels. Built by practitioners for practitioners focused on practical problem-solving and real-world use cases.","industry_vertical":"supply chain and distribution","exhibitor_mix":"Procurement technology platforms, supply chain software, sourcing solutions, contract management systems, e-procurement tools, supplier management platforms, and business intelligence providers at Innovation Park","audience_mix":"Supply chain professionals, procurement executives, category managers, sourcing directors, and supply management leaders from across industries. Over 2,000 professionals from emerging professionals to C-suite veterans expected.","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Organized by Institute for Supply Management (ISM). 15 minutes from Denver International Airport. Group discounts available for 5+ attendees. Features ISM Awards Gala and ExecIn2026 for senior leaders (VP level+).","original_event_name":"ISM World","original_event_url":"https://www.ismworld.org/events/conferences-and-events/annual-conference/","added_to_master":"2026-03-31T11:49:29.130735","master_id":33,"overall_score":8.3,"scores":{"supply_chain_vertical_alignment":{"score":8,"rationale":"Supply management and procurement professional conference. Procurement rated as 6-7 in supply chain vertical hierarchy but ISM World shows strong institutional credibility and buyer concentration. Supply management spans multiple industries including distribution, manufacturing, and logistics."},"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":9,"rationale":"Supply chain professionals, procurement executives, category managers, sourcing directors, and supply management leaders. Event explicitly targets operations and procurement functions. Hands-on workshops and problem-solving labs indicate practical, workflow-focused attendees actively seeking solutions."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":8,"rationale":"Major annual event (2,000+ attendees) in April 2026 at accessible US location (Denver/Aurora, 15 min from airport). 20-year institutional event by Institute for Supply Management signals credibility. Group discounts available. Hands-on workshop format and exec-track indicate investment in quality and specialization."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":9,"rationale":"2,000 professionals from emerging to C-suite veterans. ExecIn2026 track specifically for VP+ attendees. Hands-on, problem-solving focus attracts senior decision-makers seeking practical solutions. Built by practitioners for practitioners indicates senior buyer participation."}},"reasoning":"Excellent supply chain event with strongest combination of buyer seniority, functional alignment, and event credibility. ISM World is institutional procurement/supply management event attracting 2,000+ cross-industry professionals. April timing in Denver with dedicated VP+ track (ExecIn2026) indicates concentration of senior decision-makers. Hands-on workshop and problem-solving lab format signals practical, solution-seeking mindset. Strong speaker credibility and industry reputation indicate quality attendees.","sales_brief":"Priority #1 supply chain event for InstaLILY. ISM World combines exceptional buyer seniority (2,000+ including dedicated VP+ track), strong procurement/supply management focus, and hands-on problem-solving format. April timing + Denver + 15-min airport access = easy attendance. Institutional credibility by Institute for Supply Management ensures qualified attendees. Category managers and sourcing directors face multi-SKU, multi-location complexity identical to distribution operations. Strong buyer intent signals via workshop focus. Risk: Broad supply management scope (not distribution-specific) may require vertical targeting within event."}'::jsonb
