  'enriched',
  7.9,
  'Strong specialized supply chain event with excellent executive concentration. American Supply Chain Summit is leadership-focused platform (10-year established) attracting 300+ senior supply chain executives. April timing in Dallas is accessible. Core themes include 3PL/4PL partnerships, warehousing optimization, and AI/automation - direct alignment with InstaLILY distribution and logistics solutions. Smaller 300-person scale vs mega-conferences indicates higher quality buyer concentration and lower attendee noise.',
  'Priority #4 event for supply chain segment. American Supply Chain Summit is 10-year established leadership platform (300+ VPs/directors) focused on logistics strategy, warehousing optimization, and AI/automation. April Dallas timing is convenient. Smaller executive-focused format (vs mega-conferences) yields higher buyer concentration and easier relationship-building. Core themes include 3PL partnerships and distribution optimization = strong use case alignment. Risk: Smaller scale limits volume of prospecting but ideal for relationship depth vs. breadth.',
  '{"event_name":"American Supply Chain Summit 2026","event_url":"https://supplychainus.com/","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"original_line":13,"dates":"April 27-28, 2026","location":"Dallas, TX","cost":null,"venue":"Hilton Anatole","description":"In its 10th year, this exclusive leadership-focused platform brings together senior supply chain executives to share what''s working now and what''s next. Features 50+ expert speakers through executive case studies and strategic discussions on supply chain disruptions, resilience, and digital transformation.","industry_vertical":"supply chain and distribution","exhibitor_mix":"Supply chain technology providers, warehouse automation solutions, 3PL/4PL service providers, transportation management systems, AI and robotics vendors, logistics software, and process optimization tools","audience_mix":"Supply chain, logistics, procurement, and operations executives including VPs, directors, and senior managers. 300+ senior-level attendees from manufacturing, retail, distribution, and logistics sectors.","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Organized by Generis Group. Core themes include logistics strategy, 3PL/4PL partnerships, warehousing and distribution optimization, AI and automation, supply chain management, and supplier relationship management.","original_event_name":"American Supply Chain Summit","original_event_url":"https://supplychainus.com/","added_to_master":"2026-03-31T11:49:29.130739","master_id":35,"overall_score":7.9,"scores":{"supply_chain_vertical_alignment":{"score":7,"rationale":"Supply chain and logistics event with focus on 3PL/4PL partnerships, warehousing, distribution optimization, and supplier relationships. Strong warehousing and logistics alignment. Some 3PL/4PL content present. Broader logistics than highest-tier asset-light 3PL focus but still strong supply chain vertical."},"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":9,"rationale":"Supply chain, logistics, procurement, and operations executives. Event explicitly targets VPs, directors, and senior managers in operations and supply chain. Focus on logistics strategy, warehousing optimization, and AI/automation indicates solution-seeking operational buyers."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":8,"rationale":"Established event in 10th year (April 2026, Dallas). 300+ senior-level attendees, 50+ speakers indicate solid scale for specialized event. Dallas location is strong US hub. Smaller than mega-conferences but higher quality buyer concentration expected in 300-person executive event."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":8,"rationale":"VPs, directors, and senior managers from manufacturing, retail, distribution, and logistics sectors. Leadership-focused platform emphasizes strategic discussions and executive case studies. 300-person scale with senior focus suggests high decision-maker concentration."}},"reasoning":"Strong specialized supply chain event with excellent executive concentration. American Supply Chain Summit is leadership-focused platform (10-year established) attracting 300+ senior supply chain executives. April timing in Dallas is accessible. Core themes include 3PL/4PL partnerships, warehousing optimization, and AI/automation - direct alignment with InstaLILY distribution and logistics solutions. Smaller 300-person scale vs mega-conferences indicates higher quality buyer concentration and lower attendee noise.","sales_brief":"Priority #4 event for supply chain segment. American Supply Chain Summit is 10-year established leadership platform (300+ VPs/directors) focused on logistics strategy, warehousing optimization, and AI/automation. April Dallas timing is convenient. Smaller executive-focused format (vs mega-conferences) yields higher buyer concentration and easier relationship-building. Core themes include 3PL partnerships and distribution optimization = strong use case alignment. Risk: Smaller scale limits volume of prospecting but ideal for relationship depth vs. breadth."}':