  'Booth costs approximately $5,500 USD for 10x10 pipe and drape; attendee badges vary by registration type',
  'The specialty food industry''s premier product discovery and networking event for makers, buyers, distributors, brokers, press, and foodservice professionals. Now in its 70th year, it is one of the food industry''s tentpole events and North America''s largest specialty food trade show with nearly 2,500 brands exhibiting and more than 900 new products on display.',
