  'enriched',
  6.2,
  'Fancy Food Show has strong distribution and food supply alignment but moderate InstaLILY fit. Event is primarily product discovery and procurement marketplace rather than operations/technology conference. Buyers attend to source products, not to evaluate operational AI platforms. Large scale (47,000) and relevant buyer functions (distributors, foodservice) are positive, but event format (trade show vs. conference) and buyer intent (sourcing vs. operations improvement) reduce effectiveness.',
