 budget cycles. Established annual conference for $70+ billion electrical distribution industry. Likely 2,000+ attendees based on sector size and NAED membership (5,100+ locations). Orlando location accessible to US sales team. Proven industry standard event."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":8,"rationale":"High concentration of C-suite and senior executives indicated by description emphasizing CEOs, presidents, and senior-level decision-makers. National account executives have budget authority for operational technology. Strong presence of buyers with decision-making power for large technology investments."}},"reasoning":"NAED National Meeting is an excellent fit for InstaLILY. Electrical distribution is part of the industrial parts vertical and shares identical pain points as InstaLILY customers: large sales teams doing manual quoting and order entry, complex multi-location inventory management, and tribal knowledge concentration among veteran sales reps. The $70+ billion industry with 5,100+ locations indicates numerous mid-market to enterprise targets. Attendee profile of CEOs, presidents, and national account managers are direct buyer personas. May timing aligns with annual planning cycles and budget allocation decisions.","sales_brief":"Priority #2 Event - Perfect ICP alignment on electrical distribution vertical. Audience skews heavily toward C-suite and senior sales/operations executives with budget authority. May timing ideal for annual planning decisions. $70B industry size means abundant target accounts. Risk: Large conference format requires pre-planned outreach and account mapping strategy. Competition likely from adjacent tech solutions."}'::jsonb
