  'The fleet industry''s premier event featuring three days of unparalleled education with 60+ sessions, networking, and exhibits from 230+ leading suppliers. Attracts 2,100+ fleet professionals from corporate, government, public safety, utility, and education sectors. Co-located with Conference of Automotive Remarketing.',
