  null,
  'A premium, content-first pharmaceutical industry event specifically centered around the contract development and manufacturing (CDMO/CMO) ecosystem. Brings together the complete pharmaceutical supply chain with a focus on strategic partnerships and business development.',
  'pharmaceuticals',
  'Contract development and manufacturing organizations (CDMOs/CMOs), API and excipient suppliers, pharmaceutical equipment and technology providers, biopharmaceutical companies, packaging and drug delivery innovators, analytical chemistry service providers, containment and isolation technology vendors',
  'Pharmaceutical manufacturing executives, R&D leaders, procurement managers, supply chain directors, regulatory experts, quality professionals, business development executives from drug manufacturers, biotech companies, and pharmaceutical service providers. Expected 2,735+ attendees with decision-making authority',
  'enriched',
