  null,
  'A premier gathering of pharmaceutical industry leaders, manufacturing executives, and experts dedicated to exploring innovative strategies, emerging trends, and best practices in pharmaceutical management. Brings together senior executives focused on manufacturing excellence, quality, and supply chain optimization.',
  'pharmaceuticals',
  'Pharmaceutical manufacturing technology providers, quality management systems vendors, automation and digital transformation solutions, supply chain optimization platforms, technical operations consultants, maintenance and reliability technology companies, pharmaceutical equipment manufacturers',
  'SVPs, VPs, and Directors of Manufacturing, Technical Operations, Quality, and Supply Chain from major pharmaceutical and biopharmaceutical companies including Eli Lilly, Takeda, Bristol Myers Squibb, Halozyme, and other global pharma organizations. Approximately 200 attendees primarily at Director level and above, including Technology Leaders and Plant/Site/Facility Managers',
