  '7e50451b-0913-547b-b2f7-a1eaf4609b32',
  'International Fastener Expo 2026',
  'https://fastenershows.com/',
  'fastenershows.com',
  'October 7-9, 2026',
  '2026-10-07',
  '2026-10-09',
  'Phoenix, AZ',
  'Phoenix Convention Center',
  null,
  'The International Fastener Expo is North America''s largest B2B trade show for all types of fasteners, machinery & tooling, and other industrial products, catering to every level of the supply chain with a conference program and show floor featuring hundreds of exhibitors from around the world.',
  'industrial_parts',
  'Fastener manufacturers and suppliers, machinery and tooling companies, international factories, distributors, importers, fastener-related industrial product suppliers showcasing screws, bolts, nuts, washers, metric fasteners, structural bolts, inspection and testing equipment, packaging equipment, and specialty fastening solutions',
  'Fastener distributors, OEMs (original equipment manufacturers), suppliers, importers, sourcing professionals, mechanical and design engineers, purchasers, sales representatives, and industry professionals from construction, aerospace, military, automotive, electrical, and other industrial sectors; attracts over 4,000-5,000 attendees from 30+ countries',
  'enriched',
  8.1,
  'International Fastener Expo 2026 represents a strong fit for InstaLILY. Fastener distribution directly aligns with InstaLILY''s proven ICP - Copper State Bolt & Nut is an existing customer, validating this vertical. The event attracts 4,000-5,000 fastener distributors, importers, and OEMs across multiple industries (construction, aerospace, automotive, electrical) who manage complex multi-location operations with massive SKU catalogs. These distributors typically struggle with tribal knowledge, manual quoting workflows, and scaling operations without proportional headcount increases - exact pain points InstaLILY solves. October 2026 timing aligns with year-end budget decisions. New Phoenix location may indicate fresh attendee acquisition opportunity. Primary limitation is mixed buyer seniority - show attracts significant engineer and technician participation alongside decision-makers.',
  'Strong ICP alignment for InstaLILY - fastener distribution is proven vertical with existing Copper State customer. 4,000-5,000 attendees including fastener distributors, importers, and OEMs managing complex catalogs and multi-location operations. Sourcing professionals and purchasers indicate strong operational decision-maker presence. October timing ideal for budget cycles. Risk: Large expo format with mixed attendee levels (engineers, technicians, purchasers) requires targeted pre-show research and qualification strategy to identify highest-value distribution and OEM prospects.',
  '{"event_name":"International Fastener Expo 2026","event_url":"https://fastenershows.com/","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"dates":"October 7-9, 2026","location":"Phoenix, AZ","cost":null,"venue":"Phoenix Convention Center","description":"The International Fastener Expo is North America''s largest B2B trade show for all types of fasteners, machinery & tooling, and other industrial products, catering to every level of the supply chain with a conference program and show floor featuring hundreds of exhibitors from around the world.","industry_vertical":"industrial_parts","exhibitor_mix":"Fastener manufacturers and suppliers, machinery and tooling companies, international factories, distributors, importers, fastener-related industrial product suppliers showcasing screws, bolts, nuts, washers, metric fasteners, structural bolts, inspection and testing equipment, packaging equipment, and specialty fastening solutions","audience_mix":"Fastener distributors, OEMs (original equipment manufacturers), suppliers, importers, sourcing professionals, mechanical and design engineers, purchasers, sales representatives, and industry professionals from construction, aerospace, military, automotive, electrical, and other industrial sectors; attracts over 4,000-5,000 attendees from 30+ countries","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Complete information found including dates (Conference: October 7-9, Expo: October 8-9), venue, and comprehensive details. Specific attendee registration pricing not publicly available on the website, though there are references to registration fees and pricing options pages. The event is moving to Phoenix for the first time in 2026 from its previous Las Vegas location.","original_event_name":"International Faster Expo 2026","original_event_url":"https://fastenershows.com/","added_to_master":"2026-04-13T08:43:26.190175","master_id":42,"overall_score":8.1,"scores":{"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":9,"rationale":"Strong alignment with InstaLILY ICP. Attendee mix includes fastener distributors, sourcing professionals, purchasers, and sales representatives - core buyer personas for AI-driven quoting and operations automation. OEMs and suppliers also present represent complementary buyer profiles. Heavy concentration on sales, procurement, and supply chain operations functions."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":8,"rationale":"North Americas largest fastener B2B trade show with 4,000-5,000 attendees from 30+ countries. October 2026 timing is ideal for budget planning cycles. US-based event in Phoenix (accessible to US sales team). Well-established, reputable annual event with strong industry presence and credibility."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":7,"rationale":"Mix of decision-maker levels present. Sourcing professionals, purchasers, and sales representatives indicate operational leaders with buying authority. OEM attendance suggests some C-suite/VP participation. Primarily mid to senior management rather than pure C-suite concentration, but sufficient seniority for solution discussions."}},"reasoning":"International Fastener Expo 2026 represents a strong fit for InstaLILY. Fastener distribution directly aligns with InstaLILY''s proven ICP - Copper State Bolt & Nut is an existing customer, validating this vertical. The event attracts 4,000-5,000 fastener distributors, importers, and OEMs across multiple industries (construction, aerospace, automotive, electrical) who manage complex multi-location operations with massive SKU catalogs. These distributors typically struggle with tribal knowledge, manual quoting workflows, and scaling operations without proportional headcount increases - exact pain points InstaLILY solves. October 2026 timing aligns with year-end budget decisions. New Phoenix location may indicate fresh attendee acquisition opportunity. Primary limitation is mixed buyer seniority - show attracts significant engineer and technician participation alongside decision-makers.","sales_brief":"Strong ICP alignment for InstaLILY - fastener distribution is proven vertical with existing Copper State customer. 4,000-5,000 attendees including fastener distributors, importers, and OEMs managing complex catalogs and multi-location operations. Sourcing professionals and purchasers indicate strong operational decision-maker presence. October timing ideal for budget cycles. Risk: Large expo format with mixed attendee levels (engineers, technicians, purchasers) requires targeted pre-show research and qualification strategy to identify highest-value distribution and OEM prospects."}'::jsonb
) on conflict (id) do update set
