  '2026-06-14',
  'Alicante, Spain',
  'Meliá Villaitana',
  'Paid conference package (ground package only, flights not included, VAT included). Early bird offers available for first 50 merchant companies.',
  'A biennial conference dedicated to professionals in the building, plumbing, heating, hardware, and timber merchant sectors. Features focused business agenda with keynote speakers, insight sessions on market forecasts and economic trends, Meet the Merchant event, and Gala Dinner. Hosted by broadcaster Jake Humphrey with sessions on digitalisation, AI, retrofit market opportunities, and market adaptability.',
  'construction_supply',
  'Manufacturers and distributors serving building merchants, plumbing and heating suppliers, hardware suppliers, timber suppliers, and construction industry solution providers. NMBS suppliers offer exhibition rebates and promotions.',
  'Independent building, plumbing, heating, hardware, and timber merchant professionals, NMBS members, merchant decision-makers, and suppliers. Previous event (Cyprus 2024) attracted over 420 delegates. Mix of merchants and suppliers who use the event to strengthen business relationships.',
  'enriched',
  3.6,
  'Construction supply vertical is within InstaLILY ICP and event serves building materials merchants with operational challenges. However, fundamental geographic barrier (Spain), small scale (420 attendees), biennial timing, and moderate buyer seniority concentration make this event a poor investment. Audience focus on independent European building merchants rather than large-scale, multi-location North American distributors limits ICP alignment. International travel costs and logistical complexity outweigh potential deal flow.',
  'Pass on this event. While construction supply vertical fits ICP, Alicante location makes execution impractical for US team. 420-person biennial European conference skews toward independent merchant relationships rather than large-scale, multi-location distributors where InstaLILY drives measurable ROI. Recommend investing in North American construction supply industry events instead.',
  '{"event_name":"NMBS All-Industry Conference Alicante","event_url":"https://nmbs-conference.co.uk/","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"dates":"June 11-14, 2026","location":"Alicante, Spain","cost":"Paid conference package (ground package only, flights not included, VAT included). Early bird offers available for first 50 merchant companies.","venue":"Meliá Villaitana","description":"A biennial conference dedicated to professionals in the building, plumbing, heating, hardware, and timber merchant sectors. Features focused business agenda with keynote speakers, insight sessions on market forecasts and economic trends, Meet the Merchant event, and Gala Dinner. Hosted by broadcaster Jake Humphrey with sessions on digitalisation, AI, retrofit market opportunities, and market adaptability.","industry_vertical":"construction_supply","exhibitor_mix":"Manufacturers and distributors serving building merchants, plumbing and heating suppliers, hardware suppliers, timber suppliers, and construction industry solution providers. NMBS suppliers offer exhibition rebates and promotions.","audience_mix":"Independent building, plumbing, heating, hardware, and timber merchant professionals, NMBS members, merchant decision-makers, and suppliers. Previous event (Cyprus 2024) attracted over 420 delegates. Mix of merchants and suppliers who use the event to strengthen business relationships.","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Biennial event (runs every two years) for the building and construction merchant sector. Venue is a Mediterranean-village style resort with extensive facilities including pools, golf courses, and spa. Conference includes structured business sessions plus social activities and networking opportunities. Hosted package includes accommodation with buffet breakfast and lunches. Cancellation policies apply with fees depending on timing.","original_event_name":"NMBS All-Industry Conference Alicante","original_event_url":"https://nmbs-conference.co.uk/","added_to_master":"2026-04-30T12:08:52.587051","master_id":54,"overall_score":3.6,"scores":{"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":7,"rationale":"Event targets merchant professionals, supplier relationships, and business decision-makers in building, plumbing, heating, and hardware sectors. Functional mix includes independent merchants and supplier representatives. While these are operational and business leaders, the audience is less focused on high-volume, execution-oriented sales and operations than ideal InstaLILY buyers. More relationship-focused than transaction-process-focused."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":2,"rationale":"Event is in 2026 which passes date check, but location is Alicante, Spain creating significant accessibility barrier for US sales team. Scale is moderate (420 delegates at 2024 edition), well below InstaLILY target investment threshold. Biennial frequency means lower predictability and consistency for ongoing event strategy. International location and travel requirements reduce practical feasibility."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":6,"rationale":"Mix of independent merchant decision-makers and suppliers attending. While merchants likely hold purchase authority, the audience includes both buyers and sellers with mixed seniority levels. Not explicitly C-suite focused like premium events. Relationship-building focus suggests mid-level to senior merchant professionals rather than highest-level decision-making concentration."}},"reasoning":"Construction supply vertical is within InstaLILY ICP and event serves building materials merchants with operational challenges. However, fundamental geographic barrier (Spain), small scale (420 attendees), biennial timing, and moderate buyer seniority concentration make this event a poor investment. Audience focus on independent European building merchants rather than large-scale, multi-location North American distributors limits ICP alignment. International travel costs and logistical complexity outweigh potential deal flow.","sales_brief":"Pass on this event. While construction supply vertical fits ICP, Alicante location makes execution impractical for US team. 420-person biennial European conference skews toward independent merchant relationships rather than large-scale, multi-location distributors where InstaLILY drives measurable ROI. Recommend investing in North American construction supply industry events instead."}'::jsonb
