  '587717a6-dd08-5d95-a169-b36440cb66b7',
  'IAPD 70th Annual Convention + connecX',
  'https://iapd.org/IAPD/Events/Annual_Convention/2026-Convention-Save-the-Date.aspx',
  'iapd.org/iapd/events/annual_convention/2026-convention-save-the-date.aspx',
  'September 28 - October 1, 2026',
  '2026-09-28',
  '2026-10-01',
  'Atlanta, GA',
  'The Starling Atlanta Midtown',
  'IAPD Members: $1,299 (early bird before September 15), $1,399 (after September 15); Nonmembers: $1,799 (early bird), $1,899 (after September 15)',
  'The IAPD Annual Convention brings together members of the performance plastics supply chain for four days of industry-focused education, insightful keynotes, valuable networking opportunities, IAPD committee meetings and the connecX Trade Show. The only event focused exclusively on the performance plastics distribution supply chain.',
  'industrial_parts',
  'Performance plastics manufacturers, resin suppliers, distributors, fabricators, manufacturers'' representatives, and service providers. Exhibitors showcase performance plastics stock shapes, materials, equipment, and related products and technologies.',
  'Performance plastics distributors, fabricators, manufacturers, resin suppliers, manufacturers'' representatives, service providers, and key decision-makers from across North America. Includes C-level executives, sales professionals, purchasing managers, and operations leaders in the performance plastics industry.',
  'enriched',
  8.2,
  'IAPD 70th Annual Convention is a strong fit for InstaLILY. Performance plastics distributors operate complex, multi-location supply chains with tribal knowledge challenges, high-volume SKU management (stock shapes, materials, equipment variants), and sales teams doing repetitive manual work. This vertical falls squarely within InstaLILY industrial parts ICP. The event brings together exactly the buyer personas InstaLILY targets: distribution executives, operations leaders, and purchasing managers with direct authority over operational technology spend. September 2026 timing allows for Q4 decision cycles. connecX trade show format provides built-in booth opportunity. Primary risk is vertical focus may be narrower than broader industrial distribution events, potentially reducing addressable prospect pool, though this also reduces competitive noise and improves targeting efficiency.',
  'Solid mid-market event for performance plastics distribution vertical - a sub-segment of industrial parts ICP. Four-day format with C-suite, ops, and purchasing leaders indicates high decision-maker density and solution-seeking intent. connecX trade show enables direct engagement. September timing aligns with Q4 buying cycles. Risk: Smaller niche vertical than construction or fasteners, so pipeline volume may be more constrained than mega-events. Recommend pre-qualifying attendee lists to identify branch operators and operations directors with 5+ locations.',
  '{"event_name":"IAPD 70th Annual Convention + connecX","event_url":"https://iapd.org/IAPD/Events/Annual_Convention/2026-Convention-Save-the-Date.aspx","source":"enriched","needs_enrichment":true,"dates":"September 28 - October 1, 2026","location":"Atlanta, GA","cost":"IAPD Members: $1,299 (early bird before September 15), $1,399 (after September 15); Nonmembers: $1,799 (early bird), $1,899 (after September 15)","venue":"The Starling Atlanta Midtown","description":"The IAPD Annual Convention brings together members of the performance plastics supply chain for four days of industry-focused education, insightful keynotes, valuable networking opportunities, IAPD committee meetings and the connecX Trade Show. The only event focused exclusively on the performance plastics distribution supply chain.","industry_vertical":"industrial_parts","exhibitor_mix":"Performance plastics manufacturers, resin suppliers, distributors, fabricators, manufacturers'' representatives, and service providers. Exhibitors showcase performance plastics stock shapes, materials, equipment, and related products and technologies.","audience_mix":"Performance plastics distributors, fabricators, manufacturers, resin suppliers, manufacturers'' representatives, service providers, and key decision-makers from across North America. Includes C-level executives, sales professionals, purchasing managers, and operations leaders in the performance plastics industry.","enriched":true,"enrichment_success":true,"enrichment_notes":"Full event details successfully found. Registration pricing is based on 2025 convention rates as 2026 specific pricing not yet published. Event focuses on performance plastics distribution supply chain with private supplier meetings, connecX trade show, and networking events.","original_event_name":"Performance Plastics Annual Convention","original_event_url":"https://iapd.org/IAPD/Events/Annual_Convention/2026-Convention-Save-the-Date.aspx","added_to_master":"2026-05-01T19:48:32.231047","master_id":54,"overall_score":8.2,"scores":{"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":9,"rationale":"Strong alignment with InstaLILY ICP buyer functions. Audience explicitly includes C-level executives, sales professionals, purchasing managers, and operations leaders. Performance plastics distributors are multi-location, inventory-intensive operations with high SKU complexity - core pain points InstaLILY solves. Sales and operations functions dominate attendee profile."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":8,"rationale":"Established 70th annual convention occurring September 28-October 1, 2026 within optimal timing window. Held in Atlanta, GA - easily accessible to US-based sales team. Four-day format with dedicated trade show (connecX) indicates mature, well-resourced event. Mid-sized niche event rather than mega-conference, which can actually improve targeting precision."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":8,"rationale":"Explicitly states high concentration of C-level executives alongside sales professionals, purchasing managers, and operations leaders. Four-day event structure with committee meetings and private supplier meetings suggests senior decision-maker participation. Not a junior-heavy event - attendees have budget authority for operational technology investments."}},"reasoning":"IAPD 70th Annual Convention is a strong fit for InstaLILY. Performance plastics distributors operate complex, multi-location supply chains with tribal knowledge challenges, high-volume SKU management (stock shapes, materials, equipment variants), and sales teams doing repetitive manual work. This vertical falls squarely within InstaLILY industrial parts ICP. The event brings together exactly the buyer personas InstaLILY targets: distribution executives, operations leaders, and purchasing managers with direct authority over operational technology spend. September 2026 timing allows for Q4 decision cycles. connecX trade show format provides built-in booth opportunity. Primary risk is vertical focus may be narrower than broader industrial distribution events, potentially reducing addressable prospect pool, though this also reduces competitive noise and improves targeting efficiency.","sales_brief":"Solid mid-market event for performance plastics distribution vertical - a sub-segment of industrial parts ICP. Four-day format with C-suite, ops, and purchasing leaders indicates high decision-maker density and solution-seeking intent. connecX trade show enables direct engagement. September timing aligns with Q4 buying cycles. Risk: Smaller niche vertical than construction or fasteners, so pipeline volume may be more constrained than mega-events. Recommend pre-qualifying attendee lists to identify branch operators and operations directors with 5+ locations."}'::jsonb
) on conflict (id) do update set
  event_name = excluded.event_name, event_url = excluded.event_url,
  normalized_event_url = excluded.normalized_event_url, dates = excluded.dates,
