  'Low priority. ChemE Show targets chemical/bioprocessing engineers and plant operations, not distributors or field service companies. Inaugural 2026 event introduces execution/attendance uncertainty. No alignment with InstaLILY target verticals (construction supply, industrial parts distribution, healthcare/pharma distributors, automotive goods, food supply). Pass unless pursuing chemical plant automation partnerships.',
  '{"event_name":"ChemE Show – Powered by ACHAMA 2026","event_url":"https://www.achema.de/en/the-achama/cheme-show/short-profile","overall_score":2.1,"scores":{"buyer_functional_alignment":{"score":4,"rationale":"Audience is heavily technical and engineering-focused: chemical engineers, process engineers, CTOs, plant managers, EPC firms. While plant managers and facility planners exist, primary attendee base is technical specialists and engineering decision-makers rather than sales, operations execution, or procurement functions InstaLILY targets."},"event_scale_timing":{"score":6,"rationale":"Brand-new event launching in 2026 (June 9-10, Houston). While Houston is US-accessible and June timing is convenient, inaugural event status means uncertain attendance, speaker quality, and industry impact. Partnership between Gulf Energy and DECHEMA provides credibility, but first-year events are inherently risky investments."},"buyer_seniority":{"score":4,"rationale":"Audience includes CTOs, plant managers, biopharma executives, and facility planners suggesting some senior presence. However, emphasis on chemical engineers, process engineers, and regulatory professionals indicates significant technical/specialist representation rather than C-suite concentration."}},"reasoning":"Poor vertical alignment for InstaLILY. Event targets chemical engineers and process automation specialists rather than distributors, suppliers, or field service organizations. Industry vertical coded as other. Chemical and bioprocessing plants lack the high-volume sales team execution, multi-location branch networks, and quoting workflows InstaLILY automates. Brand-new inaugural event adds execution risk. No distributor or field service focus.","sales_brief":"Low priority. ChemE Show targets chemical/bioprocessing engineers and plant operations, not distributors or field service companies. Inaugural 2026 event introduces execution/attendance uncertainty. No alignment with InstaLILY target verticals (co